/ Input: none
/ Test 17 (bonus): copy an array with LoadI / StoreI, then print the copy
Loop,   Load Count
        Skipcond 800       / Count > 0: copy the next element
        Jump Print
        LoadI Src          / AC = M[M[Src]]
        StoreI Dst         / M[M[Dst]] = AC
        Load Src           / move both pointers on by one
        Add One
        Store Src
        Load Dst
        Add One
        Store Dst
        Load Count
        Subt One
        Store Count
        Jump Loop
Print,  Load N
        Skipcond 800       / N > 0: print the next element of Copy
        Jump Done
        LoadI P
        Output
        Load P
        Add One
        Store P
        Load N
        Subt One
        Store N
        Jump Print
Done,   Halt
Count,  Dec 3
N,      Dec 3
One,    Dec 1
Src,    Hex 022            / the address of Orig (022)
Dst,    Hex 025            / the address of Copy (025)
P,      Hex 025            / pointer used for printing Copy
Orig,   Dec 100
        Dec -200
        Hex FFFF
Copy,   Dec 0
        Dec 0
        Dec 0
